From c305517512b4f8b010c8d392b27e92dff20a4ad4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mattijn van Hoek <mattijn@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 18:41:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vegalite-spec): export a JSON Schema with CEL rules

Behind a schema feature, derive schemars::JsonSchema for the spec types and
write the schema of the five with their own Deserialize by hand. Ranges from
validate() become JSON Schema; the rules JSON Schema cannot state (an ordered
extent, strictly increasing steps, distinct parameter names and aliases) are
CEL over self in x-avenger-rules, as Kubernetes attaches CEL to OpenAPI.
examples/json_schema.rs prints it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
